title: Start
---
Well, well, look at you. Three steps from freedom, and only mildly psychologically shattered. Color me shell-shocked. #line:Level3Dialog_001
... #line:Level3Dialog_002
You know what? I found that you really deserve a chance to escape. Ok, look. Forest hides relics those looks like shells. Magical mood stabilizers. Crack 'em open, and the forest throws a tantrum. Which is exactly what you want. You break them — the illusion breaks. Then, if you're lucky and not completely cursed yet, you run. #line:Level3Dialog_003
... #line:Level3Dialog_004
The forest will retaliate. You ever see a godlike ecosystem scream in existential pain? It’s like a toddler on fire. Loud. Messy. Possibly contagious. #line:Level3Dialog_005
... #line:Level3Dialog_006
So this is it. Go hit stuff. Ruin nature’s evil mood board. And when the final door opens? Don’t ask questions. Don’t monologue. Just. Leave. #line:Level3Dialog_007
... #line:Level3Dialog_008
...And if you fail? Don’t worry. I’ll clean up your mess like I always do. Might even wear your skull as a hat. For the drama. #line:Level3Dialog_009
Bye now. Go traumatize a tree for me. #line:Level3Dialog_010
===
